Z||000006||Greg Piet||03-30-2000||04:07 PM||||The impreza had a few good runs but I think I  barely beat it, or barely lost to it.||||reg||1
Z||000007||SpeedPhreak||03-30-2000||04:18 PM||||way cool.  if i were to race cars it would definatly be rally.  r u gonna keep doin it?||||reg||1
Z||000008||Greg Piet||03-30-2000||04:21 PM||||Im not sure about the rallycross.   I had a blast, but its really hard on the little car...   If I had a few more grand a year definately(which would cover extra repairs that may be necessary).   I currently dont want to kill the car so I cant do the autocrosses which are much more frequent though||||reg||1
